**All of the C# under `chatter-mascot/` was written from scratch for
chatter-agent and contains no code derived from cc-mascot** (the
`idle_loop.vrma` above is not code)**.** The state machine of the speech queue
(`Assets/ChatterMascot/Runtime/Playback/PlaybackQueue.cs`) is a port of
`core/src/player/playbackQueue.ts`, but that TypeScript is itself a work of
this repository (written from scratch in issue #11).
